  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "Your friend Brenda hands you the cursed tape. The cursed tape is, technically, a VHS. You haven't owned a VCR in years.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Tape",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Find a VCR",
          "consequence": "Plot.",
          "nextNodeId": "s2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Refuse the tape",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s2"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "A pawn shop has a VCR. The pawn shop owner is also a rapper.",
      "sceneTitle": "The VCR",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Buy the VCR",
          "consequence": "Plot.",
          "nextNodeId": "s3"
        },
        {
          "text": "Take the rapper's number",
          "consequence": "Style.",
          "nextNodeId": "s3"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "You watch the tape. It is grainy. It is also, you realize, a karaoke video for a song you don't know.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Watch",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Try to identify the song",
          "consequence": "Investigate.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just turn it off",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "text": "Cindy, the protagonist of every Scary Movie, calls. She has been trying to call you for two films.",
      "sceneTitle": "Cindy",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Pick up",
          "consequence": "Plot.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let it go to voicemail",
          "consequence": "Style.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "text": "Your uncle's cornfield has new crop circles. The circles, drawn by aliens, are also a math joke.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Field",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Solve the math",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        },
        {
          "text": "Take a photo",
          "consequence": "Tourist.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "text": "Father Muldoon has, in his rectory, both an exorcism kit and a karaoke machine. They are, surprisingly, related.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Priest",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Use the karaoke",
          "consequence": "Plot.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        },
        {
          "text": "Use the kit",
          "consequence": "Plot.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "text": "The aliens, polite, show up at the cornfield. They have a complaint. The complaint is, technically, valid.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Aliens",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Hear them out",
          "consequence": "Civil.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        },
        {
          "text": "Apologize on behalf of humanity",
          "consequence": "Generous.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "text": "The girl from the tape, Tabitha, climbs out of a TV. She is, off-camera, exhausted.",
      "sceneTitle": "Tabitha",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Make her tea",
          "consequence": "Civil.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        },
        {
          "text": "Apologize",
          "consequence": "Polite.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "text": "You end up in a rap battle. You don't know how. The rules are, somehow, clear.",
      "sceneTitle": "Sue's Rap Battle",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Battle",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Forfeit",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "Brenda has been killed by the tape. She is, however, alive in this scene. The continuity is, again, doing its best.",
      "sceneTitle": "Brenda",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Just go with it",
          "consequence": "Style.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Question it",
          "consequence": "Comedy.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "The President — also the protagonist of the parody — is, today, addressing the nation. He has, on his desk, a chicken.",
      "sceneTitle": "The President",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Brief him",
          "consequence": "Plot.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Take the chicken",
          "consequence": "Plot.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "The press briefing involves, accidentally, the President saying the cursed tape song out loud. The press laughs. The aliens cry.",
      "sceneTitle": "Press Briefing",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Stop the briefing",
          "consequence": "Civic.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let it finish",
          "consequence": "Comedy.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "Cindy proposes a plan. The plan involves Tabitha and the karaoke machine and the rap battle.",
      "sceneTitle": "Cindy's Plan",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Adopt the plan",
          "consequence": "Trust.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Modify the plan",
          "consequence": "Improve.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "text": "Tabitha's mother, somewhere, wants to be apologized to. Tabitha is, technically, the saddest character in the movie.",
      "sceneTitle": "Mac and Tabitha",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Apologize to Tabitha's mother",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Apologize to Tabitha",
          "consequence": "Direct.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "text": "The final showdown is a karaoke night at the local bar. The aliens are surprisingly good at backup.",
      "sceneTitle": "Karaoke Showdown",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Sing",
          "consequence": "Brave.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        },
        {
          "text": "Lip sync",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "text": "The tape, finally, plays its full original recording. The recording is, in fact, a 1976 wedding video.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Tape's Origin",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Reunite the wedding party",
          "consequence": "Plot.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just delete the file",
          "consequence": "Modern.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "text": "The aliens, satisfied, leave. They take with them, oddly, the chicken.",
      "sceneTitle": "Aliens Negotiate",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Wave goodbye",
          "consequence": "Civil.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Run for the cornfield",
          "consequence": "Comedy.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "text": "Sue ends the movie with a freestyle rap about closure, family, and cursed VHS tapes.",
      "sceneTitle": "Sue, Rapping",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Drop the mic",
          "consequence": "Style.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        },
        {
          "text": "Bow",
          "consequence": "Style.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "text": "Credits roll. Bloopers. A cameo by an alien who clearly didn't sign the release.",
      "sceneTitle": "Roll Credits",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Stay for bloopers",
          "consequence": "Loyal.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Leave the theater",
          "consequence": "Practical.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "text": "Tabitha's mother, played by a famous comedian, hugs you. The hug, on screen, is the best joke of the movie.",
      "sceneTitle": "Tabitha's Mother",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Hug back",
          "consequence": "Civil.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just smile",
          "consequence": "Style.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "text": "A title card promises Scary Movie 4. Everyone, including the chicken, is back next year.",
      "sceneTitle": "Sequel Tease",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Plan to attend",
          "consequence": "Loyal.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_sing"
        },
        {
          "text": "Skip the sequel",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_aliens"
        },
        {
          "text": "Take the third path",
          "consequence": "Some endings reveal themselves last.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_wedding"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "end_sing",
      "text": "You become the karaoke champion of the county. The cursed tape, in fact, is the song that keeps winning.",
      "sceneTitle": "Karaoke Champion",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Karaoke Champion"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_aliens",
      "text": "The aliens decide to move in with you. They are, in fact, polite tenants. They pay rent in interstellar shrimp.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Aliens Move In",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "The Aliens Move In"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_wedding",
      "text": "You attend the actual 1976 wedding via a time-travel sequence you can't quite explain. You realize the cursed tape was, all along, family content.",
      "sceneTitle": "The 1976 Wedding",
